:[137.87486267089844,35.3574333190918]}}],"display_comment_original":"泰阜村周辺には、近世村の記憶として南山村、万場村、金野村などの旧村名が見える。 まずは城跡・武家文化を軸に、地区の由緒を拾える場所を探したい。 現地では南山村、万場村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["金田千鶴"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":[],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["金田千鶴研究資料 1 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-12462799","信濃教育 (1011) https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-6070575"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B0%E9%98%9C%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q131226504","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E9%87%91%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%83%E9%B6%B4&keyword=%E6%B3%B0%E9%98%9C%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"泰阜村","wikipedia_revision_id":"106952252","wikidata_qid":"Q902559","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B0%E9%98%9C%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E9%87%91%E7%94%B0%E5%8D%83%E9%B6%B4&keyword=%E6%B3%B0%E9%98%9C%E6%9D%91","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}